100 transport start
200 button LEFT_TOP down
400 encoder_value NAV 0.01
600 button LEFT_TOP up
1000 assert_view CLIPS
1200 encoder_value NAV 0.01
1500 tap LEFT_BOTTOM 60
1900 assert_mode sequencer.pattern
2200 tap MACRO_1 60
2800 tap LEFT_TOP 60
3000 button LEFT_TOP down
3700 tap LEFT_CENTER 60
4000 assert_mode view_selector
4200 button LEFT_TOP up
4500 assert_mode sequencer.clip_launcher
4700 button LEFT_TOP down
5400 tap LEFT_BOTTOM 60
5700 assert_mode view_selector
5800 button LEFT_TOP up
6100 assert_mode sequencer.clip_launcher
6500 button LEFT_CENTER down
6800 encoder_value NAV 0.01
7100 button LEFT_CENTER up
7500 encoder_value OPT 0.50
8000 marker quick_armed
10500 encoder_value OPT 0.75
10800 marker delayed_quick_edit
11000 tap LEFT_TOP 60
11400 assert_mode sequencer.clip_launcher
12000 tap LEFT_TOP 60
12500 assert_mode view_selector
12700 tap LEFT_TOP 60
13100 assert_mode sequencer.clip_launcher
13300 transport stop
